                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.74/98: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Crane</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-03-02T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 2, 1921—6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>83. Department’s 78, February 25, 7 p.m.<anchor n="27" xml:id="d387-f1"/></p>
                <p>Inform Chinese Foreign Office that Federal Telegraph Company ratified contract
                    March 1st.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
